        ["Article 7 — Data management and backup", "App data is stored on your device. You are responsible for creating your own backups from the app's settings screen when needed. The operator is not liable for loss of data caused by device failure or loss, uninstalling the App, OS updates, or other such events."],
        ["Article 8 — Disclaimer", "The operator does not warrant that the Service will suit any particular purpose, that it will have any expected functionality, accuracy or usefulness, or that it will be free of defects. Weather and place-name information shown by the App comes from external services, and its accuracy and completeness are not guaranteed. Except where caused by the operator's willful misconduct or gross negligence, the operator is not liable for damages arising from your use of the Service. Where the Consumer Contract Act or other mandatory law does not permit this disclaimer, the operator's liability is limited to the extent permitted by law."],
